  "details": "this has been an issue starting last year around October December but its only getting worse, so long story short trying to use vrcstations whilst in a saccflight air vehicle while on desktop (likely more things are being broken but this is what i know of at the moment), is causing the camera and player to be yanked from it was calibrated, I'm not entirely sure what is causing this as this wasn't an issue before on previously working worlds as they worked before whatever update from vrc broke the stations, i have updated the worlds that worked before still broken all the saccflight stuff works fine but for some reason it doesnt work anymore in vrchat\n\ni am attaching some photos that other users provided to the saccflight discord to help explain this better",
